('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000104', 3, 'post_test', 'The meaning of the symbol (aq) in a chemical equation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Aqueous (dissolved in water)', 'The correct term is: Aqueous (dissolved in water).', true),
